<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of matches in the men's Kremlin Cup tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>David Prinosil (Germany) beat Karol Kucera (Slovakia) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>2-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 6-4 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Peter Korda (Czech Republic) beat Martin Sinner (Germany) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Andrei Chesnokov (Russia) 4-6 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat 7-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) 7-6 (7-3) 5-7 6-2</p>
<p>Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat Guy Forget (France) 7-6 (8-6) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
</text>
